      "issue": "The \"Permission denied\" state defined in DESIGN.md is not rendered – no notice with a \"Choose from library\" button appears when the user rejects camera access.",
      "fix": "Implement a modal or in‑screen notice that displays the exact copy \"Camera access denied. You can select a photo from your library.\" and a primary CTA button labeled \"Choose from library\" that opens the image picker."
    },
    {
      "severity": "high",
      "file": "expo-app/src/screens/DashboardScreen.tsx",
      "issue": "The Dashboard does not render the API‑error banner (\"Failed to load data. Pull down to retry.\") nor the offline banner (\"You’re offline – data may be outdated.\") when those conditions occur, leaving state unhandled.",
      "fix": "Add a top banner component that listens for fetch errors and network status (via NetInfo). Show the exact messages with the error palette from the design tokens and a retry action."
    },
    {
      "severity": "high",
      "file": "expo-app/src/navigation/index.tsx",
      "issue": "On desktop the persistent BottomTabBar is hidden, but the left navigation drawer does not contain an Export navigation item, breaking the requirement that every primary action be reachable at all times.",
