      "issue": "The dashboard never renders the DESIGN‑specified empty state (illustration, title *No data yet*, body copy and primary CTA *Add first receipt*). When the user has no receipts or mileage the screen is blank, leaving the user without a forward path.",
      "fix": "Add a conditional that checks `receipts.length === 0 && mileages.length === 0` and displays the `EmptyState` component with the exact copy. Wire the CTA to navigate to the receipt capture flow (FAB or direct navigation)."
    },
