      "fix": "Add a full‑screen overlay component (e.g., <LoadingOverlay>) that shows ActivityIndicator and the text “Creating account…” while the sign‑up request is pending, and disable the email/password inputs and the Create account button."
    },
    {
      "severity": "high",
      "file": "expo-app/src/screens/SignUpScreen.tsx",
      "issue": "Field‑level validation errors (invalid email, weak password) are not displayed as inline HelperText with the exact messages from the spec.",
